{"id": "169143", "revid": "2441334", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=169143", "title": "Rainham (Kent)", "text": "Rainham is a town on the River Medway in the north of the English county of Kent. Together with its neighbouring towns of Gillingham, Chatham, Rochester and Strood it forms a large urban area known as the Medway Towns. \nThere is also a town of Rainham in Essex.\nGet around.\nLocal buses are operated by Arriva Medway Towns and Nu-Venture"}
